WEBVTT

00:07:58.098 --> 00:08:00.809
And it sure felt like Aristotle
would be a little annoyed,

00:08:00.851 --> 00:08:04.522
and it sure felt like Immanuel Kant
would wave a disapproving finger at me.

00:08:04.522 --> 00:08:06.982
And if all of the world's
greatest philosophers

00:08:07.024 --> 00:08:09.026
are on one side of a debate,

00:08:09.068 --> 00:08:10.903
and you are on the other side ...

00:08:10.945 --> 00:08:12.071
(Laughter)

00:08:12.112 --> 00:08:13.531
You fucked up, OK.

00:08:13.531 --> 00:08:14.698
(Laughter)

00:08:14.740 --> 00:08:17.284
(Applause)

00:08:17.284 --> 00:08:19.578
So I called the guy.

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:20.913
I apologized profusely,

00:08:20.955 --> 00:08:22.915
I told him the entire story.

00:08:22.915 --> 00:08:25.543
He was very kind and forgiving,

00:08:25.584 --> 00:08:27.962
which was an enormous relief to me.

00:08:28.003 --> 00:08:31.173
I told him I had already cut him a check,
which was in the mail.